IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `au-interpretation-time`
IMPORT `au-part6-service`

-- Tests for Part 6 (s 29 is tested in au-tests-time.l4). Expected values are written from the text.

§ `Section 28A(1): natural person`

#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a natural person` `delivering it to the person personally` FALSE
#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a natural person` `leaving it at the address of the place of residence or business of the person last known to the person serving the document` FALSE
#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a natural person` `sending it by pre-paid post to the address of the place of residence or business of the person last known to the person serving the document` FALSE
-- The body corporate methods are not listed for a natural person.
#ASSERT NOT (`service by this method is permitted` `a natural person` `leaving it at the head office, a registered office or a principal office of the body corporate` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`service by this method is permitted` `a natural person` `sending it by pre-paid post to the head office, a registered office or a principal office of the body corporate` FALSE)

§ `Section 28A(1): body corporate`

#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `leaving it at the head office, a registered office or a principal office of the body corporate` FALSE
#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `sending it by pre-paid post to the head office, a registered office or a principal office of the body corporate` FALSE
-- Personal delivery and residence or business address are listed only for a natural person.
#ASSERT NOT (`service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `delivering it to the person personally` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `leaving it at the address of the place of residence or business of the person last known to the person serving the document` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `sending it by pre-paid post to the address of the place of residence or business of the person last known to the person serving the document` FALSE)

§ `Section 28A(2): other laws and the court`

-- Not listed, and nothing else authorises it.
#ASSERT NOT (`service by this method is permitted` `a natural person` `any other method` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `any other method` FALSE)
-- Another law or the court authorises it.
#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a natural person` `any other method` TRUE
#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `any other method` TRUE
-- A method that is listed only for the other kind of person, but which another law authorises.
#ASSERT `service by this method is permitted` `a body corporate` `delivering it to the person personally` TRUE
